  "job_B1.3.31_20251001_193216": {
    "text": "XII KAL DECEMBRES, PASSIO SANCTI EADMVNDI REGIS ET MARTYRIS.\nSVM SWY\u00d0E GEL\u00c6RED MUNUC com su\u00fean ofer s\u00e6 fram sancte Benedictes stowe on \u00c6\u00feelredes\n\u00dea wurdon hi \u00e6t spr\u00e6ce o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t Dunstan rehte be sancte Eadmunde, swa swa Eadmundes swurdbora hit\n\u00dea gesette se munuc ealle \u00fea gereccednysse on anre bec, and eft \u00f0a \u00fea seo boc com to us binnan feawum\nSe munuc \u00fea Abbo binnan twam gearum gewende ham to his mynstre and wear\u00f0 sona to abbode geset\nEADMUND SE EADIGA EASTENGAL CYNINCG w\u00e6s snotor and wur\u00f0full, and wur\u00f0ode symble\nHe w\u00e6s eadmod and ge\u00feungen, and swa anr\u00e6de \u00feurhwunode \u00fe\u00e6t he nolde abugan to bysmorfullum\nGif \u00feu eart to heafodmen geset, ne ahefe \u00feu \u00f0e, ac beo betwux mannum swa swa an man of him.\nHe w\u00e6s cystig w\u00e6dlum and wydewum swa swa f\u00e6der, and mid welwillendnysse gewissode his folc\nHit gelamp \u00f0a \u00e6t nextan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Deniscan leode ferdon mid sciphere hergiende and sleande wide geond\nOn \u00feam flotan w\u00e6ron \u00fea fyrmestan heafodmen Hinguar and Hubba, geanl\u00e6hte \u00feurh deofol, and hi on\n\u00dea gewende Hinguar east mid his scipum, and Hubba belaf on Nor\u00f0hymbralande, gewunnenum sige\nHinguar \u00fea becom to eastenglum rowende, on \u00feam geare \u00fee \u00e6lfred \u00e6\u00f0elincg an and twentig geare w\u00e6s,\nAnd se fores\u00e6da Hinguar f\u00e6rlice swa swa wulf on lande bestalcode, and \u00fea leode sloh weras and wif,\nHe sende \u00f0a sona sy\u00f0\u00f0an to \u00feam cyninge beotlic \u00e6rende, \u00fe\u00e6t he abugan sceolde to his manr\u00e6dene gif\nSe \u00e6rendraca com \u00fea to Eadmunde cynincge and Hinguares \u00e6rende him ardlice abead.\nHinguar ure cyning, cene and sigef\u00e6st on s\u00e6 and on lande, h\u00e6f\u00f0 fela \u00feeoda gewyld, and com nu mid\nNu het he \u00fee d\u00e6lan \u00feine digelan goldhordas and \u00feinra yldrena gestreon ardlice wi\u00f0 hine, and \u00feu beo his\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Eadmund clypode \u00e6nne bisceop \u00fee him \u00fea gehendost w\u00e6s, and wi\u00f0 hine smeade hu he \u00feam\n\u00dea forhtode se bisceop for \u00feam f\u00e6rlican gelimpe, and for \u00fe\u00e6s cynincges life, and cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t him r\u00e6d\n\u00dea suwode se cynincg and beseah to \u00fe\u00e6re eor\u00fean, and cw\u00e6\u00fe \u00fea \u00e6t nextan cynelice him to, Eala \u00feu\nAnd se bisceop cw\u00e6\u00fe, Eala \u00feu leofa cyning, \u00fein folc li\u00f0 ofslagen, and \u00feu n\u00e6fst \u00feone fultum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Eadmund cyning swa swa he ful cene w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6s ic gewilnige and gewisce mid mode, \u00fe\u00e6t ic\nN\u00e6s me n\u00e6fre gewunelic \u00fe\u00e6t ic worhte fleames, ac ic wolde swi\u00f0or sweltan gif ic \u00feorfte for minum\n\u00c6fter \u00feysum wordum he gewende to \u00feam \u00e6rendracan \u00fee Hinguar him to sende, and s\u00e6de him unforht,\nFar nu swi\u00fee hra\u00f0e, and sege \u00feinum re\u00fean hlaforde, ne abih\u00f0 n\u00e6fre Eadmund Hingware on life,\n\u00dea gewende se \u00e6rendraca ardlice aweg, and gemette be w\u00e6ge \u00feone w\u00e6lhreowan Hingwar mid eallre\nHingwar \u00fea bebead mid bylde \u00feam sciphere \u00fe\u00e6t hi \u00fe\u00e6s cynincges anes ealle cepan sceoldon, \u00fee his\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Eadmund cynincg mid \u00feam \u00fee Hingwar com, stod innan his healle \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes gemyndig,\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea arleasan \u00fea Eadmund gebundon, and gebysmrodon huxlice, and beoton mid saglum; and swa\nHi scuton \u00fea mid gafelucum swilce him to gamenes to, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he eall w\u00e6s bes\u00e6t mid heora\n\u00dea geseah Hingwar, se arlease flotman, \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00e6\u00feela cyning nolde Criste wi\u00f0sacan, ac mid anr\u00e6dum\nBetwux \u00feam \u00fee he clypode to Criste \u00feagit, \u00fea tugon \u00fea h\u00e6\u00feenan \u00feone halgan to sl\u00e6ge, and mid anum\n\u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s sum man gehende, gehealden \u00feurh God behyd \u00feam h\u00e6\u00feenum, \u00fee \u00feis gehyrde eall, and hit eft\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a se flothere ferde eft to scipe, and behyddon \u00fe\u00e6t heafod \u00fe\u00e6s halgan Eadmundes on \u00feam\n\u00dea \u00e6fter fyrste, sy\u00f0\u00f0an hi afarene w\u00e6ron, com \u00fe\u00e6t landfolc to \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r to lafe w\u00e6s \u00fea, \u00fe\u00e6r heora\n\u00dea s\u00e6de se sceawere \u00fee hit \u00e6r geseah \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea flotmen h\u00e6fdon \u00fe\u00e6t heafod mid him, and w\u00e6s him\nHi eodon \u00fea secende ealle endemes to \u00feam wuda, secende gehw\u00e6r geond \u00feyfelas and bremelas gif hi\nW\u00e6s eac micel wundor \u00fe\u00e6t an wulf wear\u00f0 asend, \u00feurh Godes wissunge to bewerigenne \u00fe\u00e6t heafod\nHi eodon \u00fea secende, and symle clypigende, swa swa hit gewunelic is \u00feam \u00f0e on wuda ga\u00f0 oft, Hw\u00e6r\nAnd him andwyrde \u00fe\u00e6t heafod, Her, her, her; and swa gelome clypode andswarigende him eallum,\n\u00dea l\u00e6g se gr\u00e6ga wulf \u00fee bewiste \u00fe\u00e6t heafod, and mid his twam fotum h\u00e6fde \u00fe\u00e6t heafod beclypped,\n\u00dea wurdon hi ofwundrode \u00fe\u00e6s wulfes hyrdr\u00e6denne, and \u00fe\u00e6t halige heafod ham feredon mid him,\n\u00dea landleoda \u00fea si\u00fe\u00fean ledon \u00fe\u00e6t heafod to \u00feam halgan bodige, and bebyrigdon hine swa swa hi selost\nEft \u00fea on fyrste, \u00e6fter fela gearum, \u00fea seo hergung geswac and sibb wear\u00f0 forgifen \u00feam geswenctan\nHi woldon \u00fea ferian mid folclicum wur\u00f0mynte \u00feone halgan lichaman, and l\u00e6cgan innan \u00fe\u00e6re cyrcan.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s micel wundor \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s eall swa gehal swylce he cucu w\u00e6re mid cl\u00e6num lichaman, and his\nEac swilce \u00fea wunda \u00fee \u00fea w\u00e6lhreowan h\u00e6\u00feenan mid gelomum scotungum on his lice macodon,\nHis lichaman us cy\u00f0, \u00fee li\u00f0 unformolsnod, \u00fe\u00e6t he butan forligre her on worulde leofode, and mid\nSum wudewe wunode Oswyn gehaten \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s halgan byrgene on gebedum and f\u00e6stenum manega gear\nSeo wolde efsian \u00e6lce geare \u00feone Sanct, and his n\u00e6glas ceorfan syferlice mid lufe, and on scryne\n\u00dea wur\u00f0ode \u00fe\u00e6t landfolc mid geleafan \u00feone sanct, and \u00feeodred bisceop \u00feearle mid gifum on golde\n\u00dea comon on sumne s\u00e6l unges\u00e6lige \u00feeofas, eahta on anre nihte to \u00feam arwur\u00f0an halgan, woldon\nSum sloh mid slecge swi\u00f0e \u00fea h\u00e6psan, sum heora mid feolan feolode abutan, sum eac underdealf \u00fea\nMen \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6s wundrodon hu \u00fea weargas hangodon, sum on hl\u00e6ddre, sum leat to gedelfe, and \u00e6lc on his\nHi wurdon \u00fea gebrohte to \u00feam bisceope ealle, and he het hi hon on heagum gealgum ealle; ac he n\u00e6s\nAnd eac \u00fea halgan canones gehadodum forbeoda\u00f0 ge bisceopum ge preostum, to beonne embe \u00feeofas,\nEft \u00fea \u00d0eodred bisceop sceawode his bec sy\u00f0\u00f0an behreowsode mid geomerunge \u00fe\u00e6t he swa re\u00f0ne\nOn \u00feam lande w\u00e6s sum man, Leofstan gehaten, rice for worulde and unwittig for Gode, se rad to \u00feam\n\u00deis is \u00f0am gelic \u00fee se geleaffulla papa Gregorius s\u00e6de on his gesetnysse be \u00f0am halgan Laurentie \u00f0e\n\u00dea geswicon \u00fea o\u00fere to sceawigenne \u00feone martyr mid menniscum gedwylde.\nFela wundra we gehyrdon on folclicre spr\u00e6ce be \u00feam halgan Eadmunde \u00fee we her nella\u00fe on gewrite\nOn \u00feyssum halgan is swutel, and on swilcum o\u00ferum, \u00fe\u00e6t God \u00e6lmihtig m\u00e6g \u00feone man ar\u00e6ran eft on\nWyr\u00f0e is seo stow for \u00feam wur\u00f0fullan halgan \u00fe\u00e6t hi man wur\u00feige and wel gelogige mid cl\u00e6num\nNis Angelcynn bed\u00e6led Drihtnes halgena, \u00feonne on Englalanda licga\u00fe swilce halgan swylce \u00fe\u00e6s\nSynd eac fela o\u00f0re on Angelcynne halgan \u00fee fela wundra wyrca\u00f0, swa swa hit wide is cu\u00f0 \u00feam\nCrist geswutela\u00fe mannum \u00feurh his m\u00e6ran halgan \u00fe\u00e6t he is \u00e6lmihtig God \u00fee maca\u00f0 swilce wundra\nNe beo\u00f0 nane wundra geworhte \u00e6t heora byrgenum, for\u00f0an\u00fee hi ne gelyfa\u00f0 on \u00feone lifigendan Crist,\n\u00de\u00e6s him sy wuldor a mid his heofonlican f\u00e6der, and \u00feam halgan gaste a buton ende; AMEN.",
